Conclusion: after game-won the machine is inside endgame_main for good. In this build a key
pressed in either terminal loop restores the video mode and terminates the program; a build
whose 0x04f9 is `ff 46 fe eb fb` (re/notes/fanfarria-endgame-espectral.md, original/u5/play)
spins without reading the keyboard. Neither returns to the dungeon or accepts a game command.
